@page "/"

<PageTitle>BirkNext</PageTitle>

<h1>BirkNext</h1>
<p class="home-lead">Turn specification documents into structured scenarios — fast, consistently, and without manual tagging.</p>

<div class="home-cards">
    <div class="home-card">
        <h2>Extract</h2>
        <p>Paste any specification text and BirkNext automatically identifies requirements, test cases, and items needing clarification. Review the candidates, select what matters, and save them in one click.</p>
        <a href="/extract" class="home-card-link">Go to Extract &rarr;</a>
    </div>
    <div class="home-card">
        <h2>Scenarios</h2>
        <p>Browse and manage all saved scenarios for this project. Create new scenarios manually or review what was captured during extraction sessions.</p>
        <a href="/scenarios" class="home-card-link">Go to Scenarios &rarr;</a>
    </div>
</div>
